{"id":1498,"date":"2026-08-23T18:15:14","date_gmt":"2026-08-23T18:15:14","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=1498"},"modified":"2026-08-23T19:06:40","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T19:06:40","slug":"printing-your-document","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/export-share\/printing-your-document\/","title":{"rendered":"Printing Your Document"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Printing Your Document<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-1512 alignright\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PrintingYourDocument.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"80\" height=\"88\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PrintingYourDocument.webp 891w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PrintingYourDocument-272x300.webp 272w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PrintingYourDocument-768x846.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 80px) 100vw, 80px\" \/><\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">Open Publisher&#8217;s print engine is designed to produce accurate,professional output &#8211; handling full-bleed designs, mixed page orientations, and fine edge corrections automatically so your printed result <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1501\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-23-191416.png\" alt=\"Standard Printing\" width=\"261\" height=\"261\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-23-191416.png 552w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-23-191416-300x300.png 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-23-191416-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 261px) 100vw, 261px\" \/>matches what you see on screen.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Standard Printing<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">To print your document, go to <strong>File &gt; Print<\/strong> or use the print button in the ribbon. This opens your system&#8217;s print modal where you can select your printer, paper size, and number of copies.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Mixed Page Orientations<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">If your document contains a mix of portrait and landscape pages, Open Publisher handles this automatically. The print engine detects each page&#8217;s orientation and recalculates dimensions mathematically before feeding<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1503\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/MixedPageOrientations.webp\" alt=\"Mixed Page Orientations\" width=\"252\" height=\"105\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/MixedPageOrientations.webp 2296w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/MixedPageOrientations-300x125.webp 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/MixedPageOrientations-1024x427.webp 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/MixedPageOrientations-768x320.webp 768w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/MixedPageOrientations-1536x641.webp 1536w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/MixedPageOrientations-2048x855.webp 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 252px) 100vw, 252px\" \/> them into the print stream &#8211; so a landscape page between two portrait pages prints perfectly without any manual intervention.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Micro-Bleed Correction<\/span><\/h3>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1508\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/MicroBleed.webp\" alt=\"Micro-Bleed Correction\" width=\"153\" height=\"89\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/MicroBleed.webp 1375w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/MicroBleed-300x174.webp 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/MicroBleed-1024x595.webp 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/MicroBleed-768x446.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 153px) 100vw, 153px\" \/><\/p>\n<p class=\"western\">A <strong>100.4% micro-bleed<\/strong> is automatically applied during printing to eliminate the fractional white border that can appear on full-bleed designs This subtle scaling ensures your design fills the page edge-to-edge on physical output.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><\/h3>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Printing Your Document Open Publisher&#8217;s print engine is designed to produce accurate,professional output &#8211; handling full-bleed designs, mixed page orientations, and fine edge corrections automatically so your printed result matches what you see on screen. Standard Printing To print your document, go to File &gt; Print or use the print button in the ribbon. This [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1512,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[21],"class_list":["post-1498","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-export-share"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1498","targetHints":{"allow":["GET